{"id":"a9f4ef591016b200","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/174_NC¹-Frege_系统.md","title":"174 NC¹-Frege 系统","display":"174_NC¹-Frege_系统","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"174.-$NC^1$-Frege-系统\">174. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NC^1\">\\(NC^1\\)</span>-Frege 系统</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>命题变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PVar}=\\{p_0,p_1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{PVar}=\\{p_0,p_1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NC^1\">\\(NC^1\\)</span>-Frege 公式使用二元门构造符</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and}_2,\\operatorname{or}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and}_2,\\operatorname{or}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\">\\(A\\land B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\">\\(A\\lor B\\)</span>。本系统的目标差异是证明行只使用二元门公式，并由大小和深度谓词限定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NC^1\">\\(NC^1\\)</span> 行。</p>\n<p>门标记集与元数函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1}\n=\n\\{\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and}_2,\\operatorname{or}_2\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1}\n=\n\\{\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and}_2,\\operatorname{or}_2\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}:\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}:\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\top)\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\bot)=0,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{var})\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{neg})=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\top)\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\bot)=0,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{var})\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{neg})=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{imp})\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{and}_2)\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{or}_2)=2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{imp})\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{and}_2)\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{or}_2)=2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式、大小、深度与行谓词\">2. 公式、大小、深度与行谓词</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>大小函数由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(\\top)=\\operatorname{size}(\\bot)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(\\top)=\\operatorname{size}(\\bot)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(A\\circ B)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A)+\\operatorname{size}(B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(A\\circ B)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A)+\\operatorname{size}(B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\to,\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\to,\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span> 成立。深度函数由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(\\top)=\\operatorname{depth}(\\bot)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(\\top)=\\operatorname{depth}(\\bot)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{depth}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}(A\\circ B)=1+\\max(\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\operatorname{depth}(B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}(A\\circ B)=1+\\max(\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\operatorname{depth}(B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\to,\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\to,\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>固定常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 后，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c=\n\\{\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\mid \\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le c\\cdot\\lceil\\log_2(\\operatorname{size}(A)+2)\\rceil\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c=\n\\{\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\mid \\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le c\\cdot\\lceil\\log_2(\\operatorname{size}(A)+2)\\rceil\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明中的每一行都属于某个共同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c\">\\(\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、代换和上下文\">3. 自由变量、代换和上下文</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\top)=\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{FV}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\top)=\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)=\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言没有绑定构造。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{NC^1}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{NC^1}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>代换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span> 由下列全部子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\land B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\land\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\lor B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\lor\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\land B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\land\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\lor B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\lor\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{NC^1}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{NC^1}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathsf{PVar}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{p,q}(p)=\\operatorname{var}(q)\">\\(\\rho_{p,q}(p)=\\operatorname{var}(q)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{p,q}(r)=\\operatorname{var}(r)\">\\(\\rho_{p,q}(r)=\\operatorname{var}(r)\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\ne p\">\\(r\\ne p\\)</span> 成立。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{NC^1}(A,p,q)=\\widehat\\rho_{p,q}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{NC^1}(A,p,q)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{NC^1}(A,p,q)=\\widehat\\rho_{p,q}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{NC^1}(A,p,q)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,NC^1}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,NC^1}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生双条件定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单孔上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\to B\">\\(C\\to B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\to C\">\\(B\\to C\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在相同条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\land B\">\\(C\\land B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\land C\">\\(B\\land C\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在相同条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\lor B\">\\(C\\lor B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\lor C\">\\(B\\lor C\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填充函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}:\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(\\Box,A)=A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(\\neg C,A)=\\neg\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(\\Box,A)=A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(\\neg C,A)=\\neg\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C\\to B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(B\\to C,A)=B\\to\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C\\to B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(B\\to C,A)=B\\to\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C\\land B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\land B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(B\\land C,A)=B\\land\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C\\land B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\land B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(B\\land C,A)=B\\land\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C\\lor B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\lor B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(B\\lor C,A)=B\\lor\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C\\lor B,A)=\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\lor B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(B\\lor C,A)=B\\lor\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C[A]\">\\(C[A]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1}(C,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}=\n\\{\\,A\\to(B\\to A),\\ (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\ ((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A)\\mid A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}=\n\\{\\,A\\to(B\\to A),\\ (A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)),\\ ((A\\to\\bot)\\to(B\\to\\bot))\\to(B\\to A)\\mid A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>二元合取公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}=\n\\{\\,A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}=\n\\{\\,A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>二元析取公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}=\n\\{\\,A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C))\\mid A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}=\n\\{\\,A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C))\\mid A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{NC^1F}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{NC^1F}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Hilb}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\land}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lor}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>三条规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\widehat\\sigma(A)},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\widehat\\sigma(A)},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A\\leftrightarrow B}{C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}=\\{\\,((A,A\\to B),B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}=\\{\\,((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1},\\ \\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}=\\{\\,((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A))\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1},\\ \\sigma:\\mathsf{PVar}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\,\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}=\\{\\,((A\\leftrightarrow B),C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B])\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1},\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}=\\{\\,((A\\leftrightarrow B),C[A]\\leftrightarrow C[B])\\mid A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1},\\ C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1}\\,\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{NC^1F}(\\Gamma,c,\\pi,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{NC^1F}(\\Gamma,c,\\pi,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>行约束谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1}(c,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow c\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\in\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1}(c,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow c\\in\\mathbb N\\land A\\in\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span> 是有限非空公式列、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{n-1}=A\">\\(A_{n-1}=A\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1}(c,A_j)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1}(c,A_j)\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;n\">\\(j&lt;n\\)</span> 至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_j\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{NC^1F}\">\\(A_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{NC^1F}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}\">\\(((A_r,A_s),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}\">\\(((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;j\">\\(r&lt;j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}\">\\(((A_r),A_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导性\">7. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{NC^1F}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\pi\\,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{NC^1F}(\\Gamma,c,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{NC^1F}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\exists\\pi\\,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{NC^1F}(\\Gamma,c,\\pi,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标行谓词已经由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1}(c,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\operatorname{depth}(A)\n\\le c\\cdot\\lceil\\log_2(\\operatorname{size}(A)+2)\\rceil\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1}(c,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nc\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\operatorname{depth}(A)\n\\le c\\cdot\\lceil\\log_2(\\operatorname{size}(A)+2)\\rceil\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出。只允许二元门且单个证明共享同一常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，形式化地区分了本系统与无界扇入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"AC^0\">\\(AC^0\\)</span>-Frege、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TC^0\">\\(TC^0\\)</span>-Frege。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-形式系统\">9. 形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{NC^1F}=(\\mathsf{PVar},\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1},\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{size},\\operatorname{depth},(\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c)_{c\\in\\mathbb N},\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1},\\mathrm{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{Sub}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{NC^1},\\equiv_{\\alpha,NC^1},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{NC^1F},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{NC^1F},\\vdash_{NC^1F}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{NC^1F}=(\\mathsf{PVar},\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1},\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{size},\\operatorname{depth},(\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c)_{c\\in\\mathbb N},\\operatorname{LineOK}_{NC^1},\\mathrm{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{Sub}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{NC^1},\\equiv_{\\alpha,NC^1},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{NC^1},\\operatorname{fill}_{NC^1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{NC^1F},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Sub}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Ctx}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{NC^1F},\\vdash_{NC^1F}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义二元门对数深度 Frege 证明的语法和推导关系，不包含真值赋值、下界结果或复杂度定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"174.-$NC^1$-Frege-系统","text":"174. $NC^1$-Frege 系统","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式、大小、深度与行谓词","text":"2. 公式、大小、深度与行谓词","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、代换和上下文","text":"3. 自由变量、代换和上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导性","text":"7. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-形式系统","text":"9. 形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"NC^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PVar}=\\{p_0,p_1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"NC^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and}_2,\\operatorname{or}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\lor B","display":false},{"tex":"NC^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1}\n=\n\\{\\top,\\bot,\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{and}_2,\\operatorname{or}_2\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}:\\mathsf{Gate}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\top)\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\bot)=0,\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{var})\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{neg})=1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{imp})\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{and}_2)\n=\\operatorname{arity}_{NC^1}(\\operatorname{or}_2)=2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{PVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(\\top)=\\operatorname{size}(\\bot)=1,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(A\\circ B)=1+\\operatorname{size}(A)+\\operatorname{size}(B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\to,\\land,\\lor\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}(\\top)=\\operatorname{depth}(\\bot)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{depth}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=0,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}(\\neg A)=1+\\operatorname{depth}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}(A\\circ B)=1+\\max(\\operatorname{depth}(A),\\operatorname{depth}(B))","display":true},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\to,\\land,\\lor\\}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c=\n\\{\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{NC^1}\\mid \\operatorname{depth}(A)\\le c\\cdot\\lceil\\log_2(\\operatorname{size}(A)+2)\\rceil\\,\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NC^1Line}_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\top)=\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)=\\mathrm{FV}(A),","display":true}